From f21d390a962de5eafa4cc195d6aa44ec69d08079 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: duncan0k <dev@ark0.si>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 09:12:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 107/112] test: add signet_slhblock_tests and the p2mr-ts
 vectors of the message

- vectors_p2mr_ts: slh_coinbase, its txid, slh_merkle, the preimage and
  slh_msg of the three blocks of p2mr-ts (a separate TypeScript
  implementation), from vectors/m4/slh_block_message.json of p2mr-ts,
  kept unchanged inside an array as src/test/data/
  signet_slhblock_p2mr_ts.json;
- message: what slh_msg covers and what it does not;
- sign_and_verify: blocks signed with the vendored library, under the right
  and wrong keys, contexts and tags, over an uncut message, with flipped bits;
- form: every form of the SLH output that rules 4B-1 and 4B-2 reject
  (position, encoding, non-push and unparsable bytes, amount, the prefix
  elsewhere), and the forms they accept;
- height: the BIP34 heights 127 to INT_MAX - 1 around the rule's height, an
  unreadable height, the per-block log below the height, the genesis block;
- option: -signetslhblock and its errors;
- ark0_inactive: no SLH-DSA block signature on the Ark-0 signet.
